This repository contains linguistic resources generated by the tools of the
Sanskrit Heritage Platform, applied to the Sanskrit Heritage Dictionary.

It contains 4 archives:

BOOK contains the current Sanskrit Heritage Dictionary as a PDF document.

DICO contains the current hypertext version of the Sanskrit Heritage Dictionary
a a set of HTML pages.

DATA contains the linguistic data used by the Sanskrit Heritage Platform,
as Ocaml compressed remanent data files. 

XML contains XML data banks of Sanskrit forms given with their
morphological taggings. They are produced mechanically by the declension
and conjugation engines of the Sanskrit Heritage Platform, processing the
Sanskrit lexicon underlying the Sanskrit Heritage Dictionary.


